WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.754
In this video you will make OurWater work your
way.

00:00:03.874 --> 00:00:09.034
You will change the language, the look of the
words, your units and your place,

00:00:09.154 --> 00:00:12.154
and find the sharing and privacy choices.

00:00:12.983 --> 00:00:15.455
Your choices live on Settings.

00:00:15.575 --> 00:00:18.647
Press your round picture at the bottom of the
menu.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.370
A small menu opens.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.362
Press Settings.

00:00:24.183 --> 00:00:26.679
These choices are yours alone.

00:00:26.799 --> 00:00:31.047
Every change saves by itself, so there is no
Save button.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:34.082
First, Language.

00:00:34.202 --> 00:00:37.370
OurWater speaks more than sixty languages.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.298
English and Hindi are one tap away.

00:00:41.117 --> 00:00:43.517
The others are grouped by region.

00:00:43.637 --> 00:00:46.133
Press India to open its list.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:51.822
Press Download to keep a language on your
phone, so it works with no signal.

00:00:51.942 --> 00:00:54.942
A tick and Offline show it is saved.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:57.622
Now we press Hindi.

00:00:57.742 --> 00:01:03.022
The page reloads, and the menu, buttons and
titles are all in Hindi.

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:06.298
To come back, press English.

00:01:06.418 --> 00:01:10.498
The page reloads, and OurWater is in English
again.

00:01:11.317 --> 00:01:15.565
Some languages, like Arabic, are written from
right to left.

00:01:15.685 --> 00:01:17.917
Open Middle East to find it.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:22.230
Press Arabic, and the whole screen turns
around.

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:24.870
The menu moves to the right side.

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:27.678
Some lines may still be in English.

00:01:28.483 --> 00:01:30.739
Press English to turn it back.

00:01:30.859 --> 00:01:34.675
If your language is missing, press Let us know
and tell us.

00:01:35.483 --> 00:01:37.955
Now, display options.

00:01:38.075 --> 00:01:42.227
If words look small, press Large, and the
whole app grows.

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:46.578
Extra large suits bright sunlight or weak
eyes.

00:01:46.698 --> 00:01:50.034
The grey box under the sizes explains each
one.

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.914
We go back to Comfortable.

00:01:53.034 --> 00:01:58.386
A green Saved appears at the top right after
every change, so you know it is kept.

00:01:59.217 --> 00:02:01.977
Dark is gentle on the eyes at night.

00:02:02.097 --> 00:02:04.665
Light is best in strong sun.

00:02:04.785 --> 00:02:07.209
Match system follows your phone.

00:02:08.017 --> 00:02:10.201
We press Light to come back.

00:02:11.017 --> 00:02:13.945
Design changes the pictures and colours.

00:02:14.065 --> 00:02:15.937
There are four looks.

00:02:16.057 --> 00:02:18.193
We choose Design-C.

00:02:19.017 --> 00:02:22.617
On Home, the picture behind the greeting has
changed.

00:02:22.737 --> 00:02:25.041
The information is the same.

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:28.298
We choose Design-B again.

00:02:28.418 --> 00:02:32.378
Map controls decide how the map shows search
and filters.

00:02:33.183 --> 00:02:37.287
Loading screen is the water picture shown
while OurWater starts.

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:40.335
Choose one, random, or off.

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:45.590
On a touch screen, choose whether one finger
or two moves the map.

00:02:46.417 --> 00:02:49.945
Menu view decides how much of the menu you
see.

00:02:50.065 --> 00:02:53.425
We press Advanced, and more pages appear.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:58.114
Easy is where everyone starts, so we go back
to it.

00:02:58.917 --> 00:03:01.053
Four switches help you read.

00:03:01.173 --> 00:03:03.861
Bold text makes every letter heavier.

00:03:04.683 --> 00:03:09.099
High-contrast mode makes text and borders
clearer in bright sunlight.

00:03:09.917 --> 00:03:13.517
Always underline links makes links easy to
spot.

00:03:13.637 --> 00:03:16.709
Reduce motion stops moving decoration.

00:03:17.517 --> 00:03:20.733
Default location is where the map and weather
start.

00:03:20.853 --> 00:03:23.397
The blue label shows the place now.

00:03:24.217 --> 00:03:28.657
Press Use my location, and your phone tells
OurWater where you are.

00:03:28.777 --> 00:03:31.201
It may ask permission first.

00:03:32.017 --> 00:03:36.073
Or type a town or village into Search place
and press Enter.

00:03:36.193 --> 00:03:38.065
OurWater finds it.

00:03:38.883 --> 00:03:42.627
Metric is metres, millimetres and Celsius.

00:03:42.747 --> 00:03:46.443
Imperial is feet, inches and Fahrenheit.

00:03:46.563 --> 00:03:48.459
We press Imperial.

00:03:49.283 --> 00:03:52.019
My weather now shows those units.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:54.914
We press Metric again.

00:03:55.717 --> 00:03:58.549
Share OurWater shows a square code.

00:03:58.669 --> 00:04:02.581
When a neighbour scans it with their phone,
they get the right app.

00:04:03.383 --> 00:04:06.455
Copy link copies the web address for a
message.

00:04:06.575 --> 00:04:09.599
Copy image copies the code as a picture.

00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:15.337
Under Privacy and data, you can read the Terms
and the Privacy Policy again.

00:04:15.457 --> 00:04:17.689
Each opens in a new tab.

00:04:18.517 --> 00:04:22.501
Download my preferences saves your choices in
a small file.

00:04:22.621 --> 00:04:27.229
Clear local data signs you out on this device,
so use it with care.

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:31.122
Who can see each station is not set here.

00:04:31.242 --> 00:04:34.386
You choose that on the station's own page.

00:04:35.217 --> 00:04:38.601
All our lesson videos now live on our website.

00:04:38.721 --> 00:04:44.721
This button shows the address,
ourwater.org.au, in the Tutorials section.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:49.462
To start again, press Reset all settings to
defaults.

00:04:49.582 --> 00:04:52.534
OurWater asks you to confirm first.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.222
We confirm.

00:04:55.342 --> 00:05:00.334
Your place, text size, look and language go
back to how they began.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.022
That is Settings.

00:05:03.142 --> 00:05:06.430
Change what helps you, and the app remembers
it.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:09.214
Thanks for helping look after our water.
